  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>ganciclovir</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>J05AB06</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Li S et al. 2020</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>critically ill children with cytomegalovirus infection</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>ganciclovir</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_ganciclovir/Ganciclovir_Li2020v2_model_ii_the_simplest_wt_based_exponent\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>θCL (SE%)</td><td>4.57</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>θVd (SE%)</td><td>10.97</td><td>L</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>k1</td><td>0.79</td><td></td><td><small>allometric_exponent</small></td></tr></table><h4>About ganciclovir</h4><p>Ganciclovir is an antiviral drug used to treat cytomegalovirus infections, especially cytomegalovirus retinitis in people with HIV, and also eye infections such as herpes simplex virus keratitis. It is an approved medicine used in hospital settings for serious infections, and it carries a boxed warning because it can be toxic.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q417640\">Wikidata Q417640</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Ganciclovir\">Ganciclovir</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Li S et al. (2020). Population Pharmacokinetics and Dose Optimization of Ganciclovir in Critically Ill Children. <i>Frontiers in pharmacology 11:614164</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3389/fphar.2020.614164\">10.3389/fphar.2020.614164</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33536921\">33536921</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Li_2020_2: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
